WEBVTT

00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:01.081
TL;DR

00:00:01.081 --> 00:00:03.341
Six-layer architecture: sensing → streaming

00:00:03.341 --> 00:00:04.141
→ signal processing →

00:00:04.141 --> 00:00:05.441
PHM → Edge Agent

00:00:05.441 --> 00:00:07.130
→ MES/EAP safety integration.

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:09.450
Two-stage detection (Isolation Forest →

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:11.901
Autoencoder) plus RUL prediction turns

00:00:11.901 --> 00:00:13.641
raw signals into maintenance planning;

00:00:13.641 --> 00:00:15.721
figures are project-specific.

00:00:15.721 --> 00:00:17.221
Models ship through shadow

00:00:17.221 --> 00:00:19.370
deployment, canary rollout (5%

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:20.530
→ 20% → 100%),

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:22.281
then monitoring and rollback.

00:00:22.281 --> 00:00:24.441
Edge Agent, Industrial RAG, and

00:00:24.441 --> 00:00:25.901
MLOps connect evidence to

00:00:25.901 --> 00:00:28.061
workflows, but safety-critical control

00:00:28.061 --> 00:00:29.601
stays outside the LLM.

00:00:29.601 --> 00:00:31.821
Make each layer observable, verifiable,

00:00:31.821 --> 00:00:34.259
and recoverable before expanding autonomy.
